# Suspicious Unsigned Thor Scanner Execution | T1574.001 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/image_load/image_load_thor_unsigned_execution.yml
source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=7 (Image IN ("*\\thor.exe", "*\\thor64.exe")) (ImageLoaded IN ("*\\thor.exe", "*\\thor64.exe")) NOT (Signed="true" SignatureStatus="valid" Signature="Nextron Systems GmbH")
